> common as to make this unbalancing. --jmr

All you'd need is one crocodile though.  I don't think it's a good
idea.  Maybe if crocodile-skin boots were a random item type....

> [19]: Wands of cold can be used to write on water. --aristotle73

Wouldn't the letters float all over the place?  What kind of monster
